<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>500 - Erreur serveur | INFPF</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc2626 0%, #991b1b 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #1f2937;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .error-container {
            max-width: 800px;
            width: 90%;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
            overflow: hidden;
            animation: slideUp 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }

        @keyframes slideUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(30px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .error-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc2626 0%, #991b1b 100%);
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .error-header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
            animation: pulse 8s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.5; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.1); opacity: 0.8; }
        }

        .error-code {
            font-size: 8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: white;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            text-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .error-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: white;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .error-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .error-body {
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
        }

        .error-message {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }

        .error-message p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #6b7280;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .alert-box {
            background: #fef2f2;
            border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .alert-box p {
            color: #991b1b;
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b3f89 0%, #1a5bb8 100%);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(11, 63, 137, 0.3);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(11, 63, 137, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: #f3f4f6;
            color: #374151;
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: #e5e7eb;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .contact-section {
            background: #fef2f2;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-top: 2rem;
            border: 2px solid #fee2e2;
        }

        .contact-title {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #991b1b;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .contact-form {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .form-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .form-label {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #374151;
        }

        .form-input,
        .form-textarea {
            padding: 0.875rem 1rem;
            border: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-family: inherit;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            background: white;
        }

        .form-input:focus,
        .form-textarea:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #dc2626;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.1);
        }

        .form-textarea {
            resize: vertical;
            min-height: 120px;
        }

        .form-submit {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 1rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc2626 0%, #991b1b 100%);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }

        .form-submit:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.3);
        }

        .footer-links {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: #6b7280;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 1rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            color: #dc2626;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .error-code {
                font-size: 5rem;
            }

            .error-title {
                font-size: 1.5rem;
            }

            .error-subtitle {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }

            .error-body {
                padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
            }

            .actions {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .btn {
                width: 100%;
                justify-content: center;
            }
        }

        .icon {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="error-container">
        <div class="error-header">
            <div class="error-code">500</div>
            <h1 class="error-title">Erreur serveur</h1>
            <p class="error-subtitle">Une erreur technique est survenue</p>
        </div>

        <div class="error-body">
            <div class="alert-box">
                <p><strong>⚠️ Désolé pour le désagrément !</strong></p>
                <p>Une erreur interne s'est produite sur notre serveur. Nos équipes techniques ont été automatiquement notifiées et travaillent à résoudre ce problème.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="error-message">
                <p><strong>Que faire maintenant ?</strong></p>
                <p>• Essayez de rafraîchir la page dans quelques instants</p>
                <p>• Retournez à la page d'accueil</p>
                <p>• Contactez-nous si le problème persiste</p>
            </div>

            <div class="actions">
                <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">
                    <svg class="icon" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                        <path d="M10.707 2.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 0l-7 7a1 1 0 001.414 1.414L4 10.414V17a1 1 0 001 1h2a1 1 0 001-1v-2a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v2a1 1 0 001 1h2a1 1 0 001-1v-6.586l.293.293a1 1 0 001.414-1.414l-7-7z"/>
                    </svg>
                    Retour à l'accueil
                </a>
                <button onclick="location.reload()" class="btn btn-secondary">
                    <svg class="icon" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                        <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M4 2a1 1 0 011 1v2.101a7.002 7.002 0 0111.601 2.566 1 1 0 11-1.885.666A5.002 5.002 0 005.999 7H9a1 1 0 010 2H4a1 1 0 01-1-1V3a1 1 0 011-1zm.008 9.057a1 1 0 011.276.61A5.002 5.002 0 0014.001 13H11a1 1 0 110-2h5a1 1 0 011 1v5a1 1 0 11-2 0v-2.101a7.002 7.002 0 01-11.601-2.566 1 1 0 01.61-1.276z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
                    </svg>
                    Actualiser
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="contact-section">
                <h2 class="contact-title">🚨 Signaler cette erreur</h2>
                <form class="contact-form" action="mailto:elyes@xeilos.fr" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label class="form-label" for="name">Votre nom</label>
                        <input type="text" id="name" name="name" class="form-input" placeholder="Jean Dupont" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label class="form-label" for="email">Votre email</label>
                        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" class="form-input" placeholder="vous@exemple.fr" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label class="form-label" for="message">Que faisiez-vous avant cette erreur ?</label>
                        <textarea id="message" name="message" class="form-textarea" placeholder="Décrivez ce que vous avez fait juste avant l'erreur..." required></textarea>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit" class="form-submit">
                        Envoyer le rapport d'erreur
                    </button>
                </form>
                <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #991b1b;">
                    Email direct : <a href="mailto:elyes@xeilos.fr" style="color: #dc2626; font-weight: 600;">elyes@xeilos.fr</a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-links">
            <a href="/">Accueil</a>
            <a href="/formation">Formations</a>
            <a href="/contactez-nous">Contact</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>


